        rdfs:comment "The Element is a file system image that can be written to a disk (or virtual) partition."@en .

    <https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/firmware> a owl:NamedIndividual,
            ns7:SoftwarePurpose ;
